<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-preview>Las Vegas: 6 months until decorative turf irrigation is illegal.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Noto Serif Display" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-body width="620px" background-color="#f0ece4" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        .product-col { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <!-- Preheader spacer (invisible — extends preview text) -->
    <mj-section padding="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="1px" color="#f0ece4" padding="0">
          &nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="../components/header.mjml" />

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <mj-section background-color="#1b4332" padding="64px 48px 56px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" font-weight="600" color="#d4a373" letter-spacing="0.14em" text-transform="uppercase" padding-bottom="20px">
          Nevada Alert
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Noto Serif Display', Georgia, serif" font-size="46px" font-weight="700" color="#ffffff" line-height="1.10" letter-spacing="-0.01em" padding-bottom="20px">
          Jan 1, 2027:<br/>Watering Your<br/><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a8d5b5;">Grass Becomes Illegal</span>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16px" color="#a8d5b5" line-height="1.6" padding-bottom="32px">
          Nevada's restriction on decorative turf irrigation takes effect in 6 months. Here's what to do.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button align="center" background-color="#C96A2E" color="#ffffff" border-radius="2px" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="0.04em" text-transform="uppercase" inner-padding="16px 36px" href="https://www.naturesseed.com/xeriscaping/?utm_source=klaviyo&utm_campaign=xeriscape-nv-urgency&utm_content=hero">
          Shop Drought-Tolerant Seed
        </mj-button>
        <mj-divider border-color="#d4a373" border-width="3px" width="48px" padding="40px 0 0" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Body Copy P1 -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="48px 48px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="left" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" color="#3d3d3d" line-height="1.75" padding-bottom="0">
          On <strong>January 1, 2027</strong>, Southern Nevada's restriction on decorative turf irrigation takes effect. Ornamental grass in medians, commercial strips, and HOA common areas can no longer be watered with Colorado River water. Residential decorative turf that isn't functional is also targeted for phase-out.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Body Copy P2 -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 48px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="left" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" color="#3d3d3d" line-height="1.75" padding-bottom="0">
          The realistic path forward is to convert decorative turf to <strong>drought-tolerant native species</strong> that don't need supplemental irrigation once established. Bermudagrass blends, buffalo grass, and the Southwestern Wildflower Mix are the regional standards — proven on Las Vegas, Henderson, and Boulder City conversions for years.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Body Copy P3 -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 48px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="left" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" color="#3d3d3d" line-height="1.75" padding-bottom="0">
          To get ahead of the deadline, drought-tolerant seed needs to be in the ground by <strong>October 2026</strong> at the latest to allow establishment before winter. That's about four months from now to order, plant, and water in. After that, you're waiting until spring 2027 — past the deadline.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Body Copy P4 — Product intro -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="32px 48px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="left" font-family="'Noto Serif Display', Georgia, serif" font-size="20px" font-weight="600" color="#1b4332" line-height="1.3" padding-bottom="12px">
          Our picks for Las Vegas and Southern Nevada:
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Product Grid — Fixed NV products -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 40px 48px">
      <mj-column padding="8px" css-class="product-col">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Noto Serif Display', Georgia, serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="600" color="#1b4332" padding-bottom="6px">
          Bermudagrass Drought-Tolerant Blend
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" color="#6c757d" line-height="1.5" padding-bottom="12px">
          Heat and drought resistant. Thrives in Las Vegas conditions. The most reliable lawn-style xeriscape grass for Southern Nevada.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button align="center" background-color="#C96A2E" color="#ffffff" border-radius="2px" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12px" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="0.04em" text-transform="uppercase" inner-padding="10px 20px" href="https://www.naturesseed.com/xeriscaping/?utm_source=klaviyo&utm_campaign=xeriscape-nv-urgency&utm_content=p1">Shop Now</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column padding="8px" css-class="product-col">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Noto Serif Display', Georgia, serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="600" color="#1b4332" padding-bottom="6px">
          Buffalo Grass
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" color="#6c757d" line-height="1.5" padding-bottom="12px">
          Native short grass. Minimal irrigation once established. A staple of the Southwest xeriscape lawn.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button align="center" background-color="#C96A2E" color="#ffffff" border-radius="2px" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12px" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="0.04em" text-transform="uppercase" inner-padding="10px 20px" href="https://www.naturesseed.com/xeriscaping/?utm_source=klaviyo&utm_campaign=xeriscape-nv-urgency&utm_content=p2">Shop Now</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column padding="8px" css-class="product-col">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Noto Serif Display', Georgia, serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="600" color="#1b4332" padding-bottom="6px">
          Southwestern Wildflower Mix
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" color="#6c757d" line-height="1.5" padding-bottom="12px">
          Drought-adapted color. Zero irrigation after establishment. Great for HOA common areas and unused turf strips.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button align="center" background-color="#C96A2E" color="#ffffff" border-radius="2px" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12px" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="0.04em" text-transform="uppercase" inner-padding="10px 20px" href="https://www.naturesseed.com/xeriscaping/?utm_source=klaviyo&utm_campaign=xeriscape-nv-urgency&utm_content=p3">Shop Now</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- CTA Block -->
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 48px 48px" border-top="1px solid #e8e4dc">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Noto Serif Display', Georgia, serif" font-size="22px" font-weight="600" color="#1b4332" line-height="1.3" padding-bottom="12px" padding-top="40px">
          6 months. That's your window.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" color="#6c757d" line-height="1.6" padding-bottom="24px">
          Order now — ships in 1 business day, plenty of time for fall establishment before the January deadline.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button align="center" background-color="#C96A2E" color="#ffffff" border-radius="2px" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" font-weight="600" letter-spacing="0.04em" text-transform="uppercase" inner-padding="16px 36px" href="https://www.naturesseed.com/xeriscaping/?utm_source=klaviyo&utm_campaign=xeriscape-nv-urgency&utm_content=cta">
          Shop Drought-Tolerant Seed
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- USP Bar -->
    <mj-section background-color="#2d6a4f" padding="28px 40px">
      <mj-column padding="0 8px">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" font-weight="600" color="#ffffff" letter-spacing="0.06em" text-transform="uppercase" padding-bottom="4px">American Farm-Direct</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" color="#a8d5b5" line-height="1.4" padding="0">Grown on U.S. farms</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column padding="0 8px">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" font-weight="600" color="#ffffff" letter-spacing="0.06em" text-transform="uppercase" padding-bottom="4px">No GMOs</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" color="#a8d5b5" line-height="1.4" padding="0">Pure, tested seed</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column padding="0 8px">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" font-weight="600" color="#ffffff" letter-spacing="0.06em" text-transform="uppercase" padding-bottom="4px">Ships in 1 Business Day</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" color="#a8d5b5" line-height="1.4" padding="0">Fast, reliable delivery</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column padding="0 8px">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" font-weight="600" color="#ffffff" letter-spacing="0.06em" text-transform="uppercase" padding-bottom="4px">Satisfaction Guaranteed</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" color="#a8d5b5" line-height="1.4" padding="0">We stand behind our seed</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
